	"title"		"Zam's Collectibles"
	"description"		"Zamco Electronics brings the Aug Warriors trading card game to the station. Collect, trade, grade and play.

[h2]Collect[/h2]
[list]
[*]Booster packs and booster boxes for two card sets, with cards in six conditions you'll have to judge by eye
[*]Grade your best cards, seal complete sets in a Collector's Box for a premium, and keep the rest in an 8-page collection binder
[*]A new Collectible item category that only the right customers buy
[/list]

[h2]The Downside Den[/h2]
[list]
[*]Unlock a card shop down in the lower section through Wild's Network
[*]Downside Dan sells fresh packs, boxes and singles every night and buys cards over the counter
[*]Comes with the Zamco Stockist Guide (how to play and build decks) and a Zamco Authorized Dealer Certificate: put it in your display case to draw card customers
[/list]

[h2]Aug Warriors[/h2]
[list]
[*]A quick card game: fill your mercenary's body with augments, push your Power, and keep your Glitch under your Stability
[*]Build decks in deck boxes, then play the Den's regulars for credits or cards. Each save gets its own regulars, each with a hidden play style, and one of them is very, very good
[*]Card customers may challenge you to a game at your counter
[/list]

[h2]Customers[/h2]
[list]
[*]Pack flippers who sell you booster packs
[*]Deck builders who hand you a box and a wish list, with the order shown on your shop tablet
[*]Dr. Jackson sometimes has a pack on his table
[/list]

[h2]New start: Card Dealer[/h2]
Begin with the Den unlocked, three booster packs, a deck box and a binder.

[h2]Notes[/h2]
This is an early test version: expect rough edges and placeholder art. Text is in English, with a draft Chinese translation.

Save warning: cards, packs, boxes and the other items from this mod disappear from your store if you disable or remove it."
	"changenote"		"First test release"
}
